Package: florencia
Title: Detect and Correct Structural Errors in Datasets
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Linda", "Cabrera Orellana", , "lindateachtech@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1492-2546"))
Description: Provides tools to detect and correct common structural errors in messy datasets, including wide versus long format inconsistencies, embedded sub-headers, cells containing multiple values, mixed data types within a column, inconsistent categorical values (case, whitespace, accents), duplicated rows or columns, and visual formatting used to encode information (such as bold text or cell color). Designed for non-technical users without a strong background in data wrangling.
